'''To the Stars Yet to Shine''' is the [[Main Quests|Main Quest]] chapter set in [[Lahai-Roi]]. 

==List of Acts==
* Prologue - [[When the Unknown Thrums]]
* Act I - [[What Burns Beneath Frostlands]]
* Act II - [[Ode to the Second Sunrise]]
* Act III - [[The Star That Voyages Far]]
* Segue - [[All That Sunlight Touches]]
* Act IV - [[Gold Suspended in Shadows]]
* Segue - [[Rabbit Reflected in Shades]]
* Segue - [[The Flaming Red from Tomorrow]]
* Segue - [[Wishes in the Bell]]
* Act V - [[Starlights from Yesterdays]]
* Segue - [[Wishes in the Bell: Epilogue]]
* Segue - [[Beneath a Melting Night Sky]]
* Side Story - [[At Dream's Edge]] (Cyberpunk: Edgerunners Collaboration)
* Segue - [[We Choose the Sky]]

==Summary==
===Prologue - When the Unknown Thrums===
{{Quest Description|The gateway to Lahai-Roi is now open! What burns beneath the frostlands is waiting for your return!}} 

===Act I - What Burns Beneath Frostlands===
{{Quest Description|To reach Lahal-Roi in the midst of a Void Storm, you dive into the spatial tunnel, which pulls you into a strange dimension...<br>Upon arriving in Lahai-Roi, you chance upon Lynae, a student who leads you to Startorch Academy. As you begin enrollment, everything about this "academic metropolis" unfolds before your eyes. Meanwhile, shadows stir beneath the Vold Storm...}} 

===Act II - Ode to the Second Sunrise===
{{Quest Description|With the Voldworm threat gone for now, and the commencement of the New Solar Ceremony, Mornye, a Research Institute project lead, invites you to witness the rise of the new sun. However, a distress signal tells you that not everyone is looking forward to this ceremony. To uncover the truth, you and Mornye set off for the Bjartr Woods...}}

===Act III - The Star That Voyages Far===
{{Quest Description|To find the Exostrider and uncover the truth behind your frequency loss, you step into the falling snow and venture toward the silent, pale expanse of the frostlands.<br>Following the traces she had left behind, you pass by a calm and ordinary lake, where the Exostrider in the frostlands is awaiting your arrival.<br>The road trip movie is nearing its end, and your journey together has truly made her happy and content.}}

===Segue - All That Sunlight Touches===
{{Quest Description|To reach your goal, you delve deeper into the Exostrider plan, all the while, anomalies hidden in the frostlands reveal themselves.}}

===Act IV - Gold Suspended in Shadows===
{{Quest Description|The New Solar Celebration is just around the corner. Yet, President Lucilla detects a mysterious frequency appearing in the Academy's Dark Side—one that does not belong to the Academy. You suspect it may be the "reward" once mentioned by the Grand Architect of the Fractsidus. Determined to uncover the truth behind this anomaly, you venture into the Dark Side alongside Sigrika, a student you encountered there...}}

===Segue - Rabbit Reflected in Shades===
{{Quest Description|After the New Solar Celebration comes to an end, Lucilla sends you a WaveLine message, saying that the root of the Dark Side anomaly remains unresolved. She hopes you can help her uncover the truth...}}

===Segue - The Flaming Red from Tomorrow===
{{Quest Description|After the Dark Side incident comes to an end, Lucilla meets with Hiyuki at the auditorium. Lucilla suspects that the Fractsidus may be plotting something far more dangerous behind the scenes...}}

===Segue - Wishes in the Bell===
{{Quest Description|Voidmatter concentration in Lahai-Roi is intensifying. Before assigning Hiyuki her next mission, Lucilla hoped Hiyuki would take a trip back to Honami... But once there, Hiyuki met...}}

===Act V - Starlights from Yesterday===
{{Quest Description|Take action... for the hopes of many, and for the paper plane that once slipped through your fingers.}}

===Segue - Wishes in the Bell: Epilogue===
{{Quest Description|With the events of Lahai-Roi over... Hiyuki returns to Honami. After all, she must complete the final Purge.}}

===Segue - Beneath a Melting Night Sky===
{{Quest Description|Not long after the Stridergate incident, the Spacetrek Collective informs you that Denia is awake and being kept in isolation. To learn the Fractsidus's next step and open new directions for future research, you head to the infirmary to negotiate with Denia. There, she offers you a "deal." In exchange, you'll need to stay with her for her birthday...}}

===Side Story - At Dream's Edge===
{{Quest Description|A Somnoire door has suddenly appeared in the Academy. Mornye has asked for your help investigating it.}}

===Segue - We Choose the Sky===
{{Quest Description|Though the Threnodian Aleph-1 was banished, Lucilla finds herself in yet another predicament. In the absence of the Exostrider, funders are questioning whether the Synchronist program—and even the Rabelle College itself—should continue to exist. As both a professor and the head of the Academy, Lucilla must now choose between harsh reality and her ideals.}}

